Score 1VP each time an enemy unit does any of these:
• fails a Morale test;
• Falls Back;
• fails an action.
Also, each time a melee attack made by one of your DRUKHARI models destroys an enemy unit, roll 2D6 before you remove the last model of that unit from the battlefield. If the result is equal to or higher than that enemy model's Leadership characteristic, score 1VP. A model that is brought back for any reason (destroyed and then returned to the battlefield) can score you VP from this secondary objective more than once, if it is brought back and destroyed again several times and your 2D6 result equals or beats that model's Leadership characteristic each time.
